{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2023-04-10 11:12:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT TO SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "NEW ORLEANS, APRIL 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ENTERGY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.07 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 1, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 4, 2023."}